			<category term="HEALTH AND PERSONAL SOCIAL SERVICES"/>
			<summary>These Regulations, which come into operation on 1st July 2008 and have effect retrospectively from 1st April 2008, apply to people employed in Health and Social Care on or after 1st April 2008 or in such employment immediately before that date, but not in the pension scheme contained in the Health and Personal Social Services (Superannuation) Regulations (Northern Ireland) 1995 (S.R. 1995 No. 95) and wishing to join under these arrangements.</summary>
